{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33494","headline":"东归留辞沈侍郎 · 许棠","name":"东归留辞沈侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一第久乖期，深心已自疑。\n沧江归恨远，紫阁别愁迟。\n稽古成何事，龙锺负已知。\n依门非近日，不虑旧恩移。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}